🇦🇲 Armenian Prime Minister Nikol Pashinyan announces that Armenia will submit an application for membership in the European Union:

“Armenia must first submit an official application for EU membership. It is likely that we will initiate this process in the near future, especially considering the pressing demands of our partners in the Eurasian Economic Union. A referendum will be held after the official application is submitted to the EU, an appropriate response is received, and an action plan is developed”.

